|------|---------|-------|-----|
| Q1 | `castVote()` when non-null | master mute + `es_voteTick === '1'` | `es_voteTick` |
| Q2 | `VotesRevealed` handler | `document.hidden` + Notification permission + `es_desktopNotify === '1'` | `es_desktopNotify` |

No server changes. No CSS changes.
