<h2 id="seasonal-overview">🗓️ Seasonal Expansion — Design</h2>

<div class="callout note">
  <strong>From 8 → 39 events</strong>
  The seasonal system is redesigned with a data-table architecture, a priority resolver for overlaps, and variable-date support for lunar calendar events.
</div>

<h3>Priority System</h3>
<p>When multiple events overlap on a given date, the resolver picks the <b>lowest priority number</b> (highest priority). Tiebreak: shorter duration wins.</p>
<div class="table-wrap"><table>
  <tr><th>Priority</th><th>Type</th><th>Examples</th></tr>
  <tr><td><span class="badge badge-red">P1</span></td><td>Very short specific day (1–2 days)</td><td>Pi Day, April Fools, Star Wars Day, Tanabata, Bastille Day, Solstices</td></tr>
  <tr><td><span class="badge badge-yellow">P2</span></td><td>Holiday / Major Event (3–14 days)</td><td>Valentine's, Halloween, Christmas, Lunar New Year, Diwali, Hanami, Ocean Week</td></tr>
  <tr><td><span class="badge badge-cyan">P3</span></td><td>Cultural event (2–6 weeks)</td><td>Pride Month, Oktoberfest, Awards Season, Ramadan/Eid, Thanksgiving</td></tr>
  <tr><td><span class="badge badge-green">P4</span></td><td>Long season (months, background)</td><td>Deep Winter, Spring, Summer, Autumn</td></tr>
</table></div>

<h3>Variable Date Support</h3>
<pre><code>const LUNAR_DATES = {
    2024: { lunarNewYear: [2,10], diwali: [11,1], midAutumn: [9,17] },
    2025: { lunarNewYear: [1,29], diwali: [10,20], midAutumn: [10,6] },
    2026: { lunarNewYear: [2,17], diwali: [11,8],  midAutumn: [9,25] }
};

const RAMADAN_DATES = {
    2024: [3,11], 2025: [3,1], 2026: [2,18]  // approx start (30-day window)
};

// Pancake Day = Shrove Tuesday = Easter - 47 days (Meeus algorithm)
// August Bank Holiday = last Monday of August</code></pre>

<h3>Architecture: SEA_EVENT_TABLE</h3>
<p>Replaces the if-else chain in <code>_seaGetSeason()</code> and <code>_getSeasonalOverride()</code>:</p>
<pre><code>// [key, m1, d1, m2, d2, priority, settingKey]
// m1=0 → variable date, resolved at runtime
const SEA_EVENT_TABLE = [
    ['newyear',       1, 1,  1, 10,  2, 'seasonalNewYear'],
    ['deepwinter',    1, 11, 1, 31,  4, 'seasonalDeepWinter'],
    ['lunarnew',      0, 0,  0, 5,   2, 'seasonalLunarNew'],   // ±5-day window
    ['awards',        2, 1,  2, 28,  3, 'seasonalAwards'],
    ['valentine',     2, 12, 2, 16,  2, 'seasonalValentine'],
    ['pancakeday',    0, 0,  0, 1,   1, 'seasonalPancakeDay'],
    ['piday',         3, 14, 3, 14,  1, 'seasonalPiDay'],
    ['stpatricks',    3, 15, 3, 18,  2, 'seasonalStPatricks'],
    // ... (39 total)
];</code></pre>

