<h2 id="architecture">1. Architecture Overview</h2>

<h3>Existing Stack (Unchanged)</h3>
<div class="table-wrap"><table>
  <tr><th>Layer</th><th>Technology</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Backend</td><td>ASP.NET Core 10, C#, SignalR Hub (<code>PokerHub.cs</code>)</td></tr>
