<div class="feature-tier">
  <div class="feature-tier-header">
    <h3 id="counter-spell" style="margin:0">🪄 Lone Wolf Counter-Spell <span class="badge badge-yellow">#10</span></h3>
    <span class="effort-pill medium">~3 days</span>
  </div>
  <p><b>Concept:</b> The shamed participant gets a <b>once-per-session</b> "Counter-Spell" button that deflects attention. All <i>other</i> participants' avatars turn into chickens 🐔 for 10 seconds. Encourages participation: being the outlier becomes empowering, not punishing.</p>

  <h4>Backend</h4>
  <pre><code><span class="kw">public async</span> Task <span class="fn">CastCounterSpell</span>()
{
    <span class="kw">var</span> room = <span class="fn">CurrentRoom</span>();
    <span class="kw">var</span> me = room.Participants.<span class="fn">FirstOrDefault</span>(p => p.ConnectionId == Context.ConnectionId);
    <span class="kw">if</span> (me == <span class="kw">null</span> || me.CounterUsed) <span class="kw">return</span>;
    me.CounterUsed = <span class="kw">true</span>;
    <span class="kw">await</span> Clients.Group(room.Name).<span class="fn">SendAsync</span>(<span class="str">"CounterSpellCast"</span>, me.ConnectionId, me.Name);
}</code></pre>

  <h4>Frontend</h4>
  <ul>
    <li>Server emits <code>CounterSpellCast</code> with caster's ID + name</li>
    <li>All <i>other</i> clients apply <code>.chicken-mode</code> class to avatar wrappers for 10s — replaces avatar with 🐔 emoji + clucking jiggle</li>
    <li>The caster sees: "🪄 You turned the room into chickens!"</li>
    <li>The shame overlay dismisses immediately on counter-spell cast</li>
  </ul>

  <pre><code><span class="op">@keyframes</span> chicken-jiggle {
  0%,100% { transform: rotate(-5deg) translateY(0); }
  25%     { transform: rotate(5deg)  translateY(-3px); }
  75%     { transform: rotate(-3deg) translateY(2px); }
}
.chicken-mode { font-size: 2.6rem; }
.chicken-mode::before { content: <span class="str">'🐔'</span>; animation: chicken-jiggle 0.5s infinite; }
.chicken-mode img, .chicken-mode svg, .chicken-mode .av-initials { display: none; }</code></pre>
